{"tool_name":"neurolucida","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>Neurolucida is a powerful tool for creating and analyzing realistic, meaningful, and quantifiable neuron reconstructions from microscope images. Perform detailed morphometric analysis of neurons, such as quantifying 1) the number of dendrites, axons, nodes, synapses, and spines, 2) the length, width, and volume of dendrites and axons, 3) the area and volume of the soma, and 4) the complexity and extension of neurons. See 10.3389/fnins.2012.00049</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Neurolucida is a powerful tool for creating and analyzing realistic, meaningful, and quantifiable neuron reconstructions from microscope images. Perform detailed morphometric analysis of neurons, such as quantifying 1) the number of dendrites, axons, nodes, synapses, and spines, 2) the length, width, and volume of dendrites and axons, 3) the area and volume of the soma, and 4) the complexity and extension of neurons. See 10.3389/fnins.2012.00049</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-03-05T10:28:30+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2017-02-13T12:27:00+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4438,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"efbc83c8-a58e-46c3-957a-54540ef50712","url":"/taxonomy/term/4438"},{"target_id":4242,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"66d29d36-42bf-4786-ba77-479ecb13b947","url":"/taxonomy/term/4242"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505227293,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":5040,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"ee6f72b3-b889-4480-94bb-eb09037eb8f0","url":"/taxonomy/term/5040"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":17